,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡田 純子","creatorId":"vndb:s1120","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1120","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1120","name":"岡田 純子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11527","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1537","characterName":"榛名 亮","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1537"},"originalCharacterName":"榛名 亮","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haruna Ryou is a serious soldier. He’s had 7 decorated years within the army and a very successful career within the special forces. However, perhaps because of the time he spent in battle, he’s quite emotionless, never letting emotions get in the way of method."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Choux's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1537"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a6ca3ba30783342027beb12d8ff7d058649f4744c72d30b06a6af715a7751ff.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/103a7377babf70fbcbbdca190a64ba9b5ccf839b534d82f9035ea299a116cd60.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"間島 淳司","creatorId":"vndb:s756","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s756","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s756","name":"間島 淳司","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11523","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"船橋 まい","creatorId":"vndb:s852","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s852","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s852","name":"船橋 まい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11531","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1538","characterName":"シオン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1538"},"originalCharacterName":"シオン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"100"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sion, celebrated as the Felix who saved humanity, stands at the forefront of the Earth Evacuation Project's migrant ship development. Despite her appearance as a young girl in her early teens, she is, in fact, over a hundred years old due to her Felix nature. This extraordinary age imparts to her a distinctive, somewhat nihilistic personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her longevity has sparked rumors that she is nearing the end of Felix's lifespan, a notion she does not contradict. Sion has spent her entire life within the confines of a research facility, nurturing a deep yearning for the world beyond its walls. However, she is resigned to her fate, understanding that her crucial role and unique identity as a Felix restrict her from experiencing this freedom."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sion is not only an extraordinary intellect in mechanical engineering but has also been instrumental in the broader aspects of the evacuation project, including organizational and political negotiations. Her significant contributions and visibility have led to her being used as a figure in political propaganda, making her a target of numerous adversaries. To the public, she presents a dignified, almost princess-like front, never revealing any weakness. Yet, this façade conceals an innocent and pure heart, untouched by the world outside her sheltered life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1538"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3577b9e6b8f8e4b99db07810bba33bb06544db4f0747dfec9c0b6acfe92cb22.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d1f441ce0c772bff282b63194993c45ba8f74f8e0d2f3f0ce6acbddd9433e9c5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"志村 由美","creatorId":"vndb:s198","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s198","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s198","name":"志村由美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11520","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1539","characterName":"浅井・F・ラヴィニア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1539"},"originalCharacterName":"浅井・F・ラヴィニア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asai F. Lavinia is Ryou’s partner in protecting Sion. She’s quite cheerful and carefree on the surface, but she of the same rank as Ryou, having been through many battlefields to get there. Unlike Ryou, however, she specializes in close range combat with blades, and has a special love for swords."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Choux's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1539"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0ab2a3f9cdc96a6cd1c9d06ea18018035dc3f7f6e6cc3dd907a97960ad97e74b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42cdfd576b72750fd818b66e2268703f79f2bb0148c7e08e0b29012338f3eb1f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村 繪里子","creatorId":"vndb:s1648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1648","name":"中村 繪里子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11529","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1540","characterName":"エリカ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1540"},"originalCharacterName":"エリカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"100"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Elica is the one and only maid at the research facility. She attends to Sion’s personal needs, and is a cheerful older sister to everyone (as you can tell, she also has a tendency to over-dramatize situation). She also possesses the usual skills of a maid: the ability to do laundry, cook good food, brew excellent tea, clean, martial arts, etc."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Choux's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1540"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/11c5db47b18a6589898724842e62eda01762fa0893ca535b2ae8b458fc9329ae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/461415c0d4303d6f515ddabfd9823f324c84f702cb93c89d1ea829e0d5b28755.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中島 裕美子","creatorId":"vndb:s1119","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1119","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1119","name":"中島 裕美子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11525","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1541","characterName":"稲葉 直人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1541"},"originalCharacterName":"稲葉 直人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status"